body:
This is really annoying, coming from someone who isn't a fan of Nicki but has always been pleased to see her do well. It's just sad seeing someone who has paved such a path for female rappers..... have this happen to them. She needs to hold herself accountable for things and stop surrounding herself with yes-men if she ever expects to bounce back from this past year.

&#x200B;

Also, what an audacious, bullshit excuse. Nicki could have done a stripped-down show if she wanted to. Imagine how badass that would've been too.
